e_name": "screenshot02.png", "id": "1167270421589414", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393425_1167270424922747_1907140739452079368_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=u032ISkRx8oQ7kNvwHvkCRc&_nc_oc=AdqDi8L9st1XuiIy1XgiEqaKUhgpDgRpL6gdB1ChM3_3rdFYw5NoDJ_c0Vk_tw3EEzk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8zaY3tRSYgdHW_ymiOD1uOaijkzfSfK8Gb4DKB5_pKuQ&oe=6A47D079"}, {"file_name": "screenshot03.png", "id": "1320236425766559", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392005_1320236429099892_7026969068655260219_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WATPRXriHzsQ7kNvwFhdfXx&_nc_oc=AdqRYNHsrycfJP9Us4uRyIvEG61Q2iw3M3KhNH5YUA2ALuwg-dEk2dobbIKIDyT1ado&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8q9X9me0X0iOaWpAFsw70zsGuvGPI5qKfhoxbOYU2vmg&oe=6A47E013"}, {"file_name": "screenshot04.png", "id": "1408931723813604", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391949_1408931727146937_1574658016866773147_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=z59F3hjU27sQ7kNvwGVcv-7&_nc_oc=AdpocM7NXFK2N187vNtI4Lg_d1V2f6hjUneNeCZ5NtpzBb5Rf-wCxAjDqSyLEqAsE_Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8YOHpzFXXURXqpLmbbtjinQPO5cmsaOUBSn7oSUbt1Fw&oe=6A47B37B"}, {"file_name": "screenshot05.png", "id": "418176134719567", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391998_418176138052900_6204508764481913331_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZL7t1IFYd_8Q7kNvwHSQUe_&_nc_oc=Adp3NYuV57ENyBT3XMwxreGYATSh_phNAlZbSFnKGyK8m2YV3PQyrKfdfAoMiP-x6Rg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9JXpuRKs6ZCxKXBCTZQQZHK-2nNn9XuKguZubqPzqPag&oe=6A47B4CA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail2.png", "id": "1152565683077389", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391896_1152565689744055_250834400001166292_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vISRBrcHLskQ7kNvwHtrsz0&_nc_oc=AdolZ94pvUtgmrLZ4T3C68lxPBz-sHde7rYe3jQ1AidKjEw8jDaBiimZ2j1VKXE4SL4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-69dc5TY2Fkbycc794O4JO5YzeNMyPxF-sOX4_MsclZg&oe=6A47D63E"}, "display_name": "Aerodrums 2", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking.\n\nAerodrums 2 is an expressive and versatile air drumming instrument. It is a standalone device that uses high-speed optical motion capture technology to accurately track the position of your drumsticks and feet in 3D. Unlike acoustic and traditional electronic drum sets, Aerodrums 2 is lightweight and portable, it is silent when used with headphones, and it takes up no space when not in use.\n\nPaired with Meta Quest headsets, Aerodrums 2 offers an unparalleled drumming experience. Passthrough mode and depth occlusion let you see your real hands and drumsticks while drumming, while hand-tracking is used to further improve stick-tracking accuracy.\n\nTo learn more about Aerodrums 2 visit aerodrums.com", "short_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking."}]}, "developer_name": "Aerodrums", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aerodrums.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_se